time Box

scale slot 12s 6
row block
zoom 0-2

box proposer
box block

step Propose
  say A box line puts the same box in every column of the zoom band.
  proposer -> block [at: 0]
  now -> 0

step Next
  say Declare a box once, and it shows in every column in the same order.
  proposer -> block [at: 1]
  now -> 1
